-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"constraints":"Use requested.dimensions; rectangle uses source pixels, not browser coordinates. Preserve source; review rendered crop before export. Cropping can discard context even when coordinates are valid.","options":["crop","leave"],"question":"Does the crop preserve the subject and intended context?"},"key":"composition","section":"judge"}
J composition crop|leave:"Does the crop preserve the subject and intended context?" -- Use requested.dimensions; rectangle uses source pixels, not browser coordinates. Preserve source; review rendered crop before export. Cropping can discard context even when coordinates are valid.
V J composition -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
