J export export|leave:"Is this reviewed image ready to save at the new destination?" -- Destination must be absent inside allowed workspace/project and owner-approved; retain the original source. Backend export copies exact asset bytes.
V J export -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Source changed after open","recovery":"Reopen original and recompute region; hash mismatch blocks edits"},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X Source changed after open -> Reopen original and recompute region; hash mismatch blocks edits
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Crop exceeds dimensions","recovery":"Use integer pixel rectangle within requested width/height"},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X Crop exceeds dimensions -> Use integer pixel rectangle within requested width/height
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Generation is running/busy/uncertain","recovery":"Observe image.state and saved provider artifact; same requestId replays, never use new ID just to retry uncertain work"},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X Generation is running/busy/uncertain -> Observe image.state and saved provider artifact; same requestId replays, never use new ID just to retry uncertain work
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Export path already exists","recovery":"Select a new path; export never replaces files"},"key":"3","section":"pitfalls"}
X Export path already exists -> Select a new path; export never replaces files
